(:id "port/python/vt/union-table-arms" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/pythontable/vtunions_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtUnionsRows/union-table-arms (manifest rows m1_open, m1_save, m2_close, m2_open, m1_open_as_m2, m1_save_as_m2, m2_close_as_m1, m2_open_as_m1, message_arms, message_arm_edits, and the unions_maps_keyed construct)" "internal/codegen/pythontable/vtunions_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtUnionsRowsNegativeControl/variable-arm-length, /variable-length-arm-in-place, /fixed-arm-dropped, /fixed-refusal-touches-report (each fault planted in a COPY of the emitted runtime) and TestPythonVtUnionsRowsControlsCoverEveryCase" "make python-vt-unions-rows python-vt-unions-rows-negative-control (make/python-vt-unions-rows.mk); make/negative-controls.d/python-vt-unions-rows-negative-control.json" "internal/codegen/pythontable/pythontable_unions_test.go: TestPythonVtUnions and TestPythonVtUnionsNegativeControl (the construct cases)") :tested-revision "106fb9b0dac0aec34f86406d7ec90d557466614c" :note "2026-11-17: every manifest instance and report row of the row, and the unions_maps_keyed construct, is read by the Go engine and by the generated package under both pinned interpreters (CPython 3.11.18 and 3.15.2) at the root's declared form: the fixed roots (tblm1 and tblm2 Msg, messagedemo ToolMessage) read form 3 and write back the canonical wire byte for byte with the measure equal to the length; the four evolution report rows are form-1 files at a fixed root and refuse as previous_form, as reports.txt says, with the caller's buffer and LoadReport untouched. Each case is named by a planted control that turns it red. Run on macOS arm64 at 106fb9b0dac0aec34f86406d7ec90d557466614c with SCHEMA_SLOW=1, -tags schema_leg_python and make dist-python (the pinned interpreters from the fleet SDK).")

